dsh-yamada-night-shift / 山田的夜班
===================================

Code and compatibility scaffold
---------------------------------

The plugin lifecycle, DSH client wiring, compatibility selectors, and build
shape were adapted from `maid-atelier` in Small-tailqwq/dsh-deep-whale:

https://github.com/Small-tailqwq/dsh-deep-whale

The adapted work remains under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. Keep this notice, the LICENSE
file, and the upstream attribution when copying or modifying this project.

Visual assets
-------------

The shipped character and night-background assets were created for this skin
with OpenAI image generation, using user-supplied Yamada visual references.
The repository also preserves the migrated reference images and UI-development
history under `../assets/ui-history/` for project provenance.

No artwork from the dsh-deep-whale maid skin is included in the runtime bundle.

